---
title: "is_qualified_to_create_referral_code (protocol::referral)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_exists: self, who
    q_check_exists --> q_return_false: !self.accumulated_deposit_only_usd.contains(who)
    q_check_exists --> q_load: self.accumulated_deposit_only_usd.contains(who)
    q_return_false --> [*]: return false
    q_load --> q_compare: current = *self.accumulated_deposit_only_usd.borrow(who)
    q_compare --> [*]: return current >= self.referrer_deposit_usd_threshold

    note right of q_compare
        INV-001: Returns true only if accumulated deposit >= threshold
        INV-002: Returns false if user has no deposit record at all
    end note
